Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 00:02:11 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1183/1198] HERESY 1168: the lyrics' meter: each line's
 syllables against its group's ruler, the counts under the box, the spelling
 check, a box drawn by hand
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor, 06.10.2026, the night: «В поле редактора Лирики можешь прикрутить ересь?… когда пишешь лирику, нужна не только
рифма, но и длина строк, чтобы ложились на общий такт. Некий визуализатор длин строк, вертикальную линейку, которая по
куплету+мосту будет едино мерить. По при-корусу и корусу — отдельно. Там же разные такты и темпы… браузер встроенный спелл
чекер… внизу текстового поля Лирики подсчёт символов/знаков самой лирики, и отдельно служебные теги разделов и то, что в
скобках круглых»; «разреши ручную растяжку поля лирики по высоте… поле лирики можно увеличить на десять строк».

heresy-lyrics.js (HeresyLyrics.attach): beside each line its syllables as a bar against the ruler of its group (verse and
bridge one, the pre-chorus its own, the chorus its own, any other section its own; the ruler at the group's median, the
rows of a group one vertical line; within a syllable green, two or three amber, more red); what is in round brackets hatched
after the bar (it may be sung). Syllables: vowels; ע counts (his soft о/а), stress marks do not, a Latin letter in a
Russian word counts (his hard o); English vowel groups, Greek vowels, Hebrew points and the shuruk. A mirror of the box wraps
the lines as it does, so each row stands beside its line through wrapping and scrolling. Under the box: the lyrics'
characters, syllables and lines; the tags; the brackets; the phonetic hand (stress marks, ayins, Latin letters in Russian
words); the browser's spelling check in the lyrics' language (Russian, or Ukrainian or Belarusian when the style says so,
Greek, English), switched off there; a box drawn by hand keeps its height (and in this browser) until «Auto height». The box
16 rows, growing to 26. All the words in six catalogs.

The suite: 365 passed, 0 failed (2 new checks).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
